                                        "sense_id": "4881c4bb-9e58-3612-9271-7029c9e91bca",
                                        "entry_id": "c3b4bd37-84f9-3818-99f4-6d36d08ffe2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden, involuntary contraction of a muscle, a group of muscles, or a hollow organ."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27125454-c3e8-4df1-85dd-c68d07e87be4",
                                                "sense_id": "4881c4bb-9e58-3612-9271-7029c9e91bca",
                                                "text": "Jessica went into spasms after eating a peanut."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c332b982-869e-340f-a660-0134ff95ab6b",
                                        "entry_id": "c3b4bd37-84f9-3818-99f4-6d36d08ffe2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A violent, excruciating seizure of pain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52fba30d-adf0-3f14-844a-bfcba01b2c57",
                                        "entry_id": "c3b4bd37-84f9-3818-99f4-6d36d08ffe2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden and temporary burst of energy, activity, or emotion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fdc345b-5c8e-410f-8a58-966dd16f7cba",
                                                "sense_id": "52fba30d-adf0-3f14-844a-bfcba01b2c57",
                                                "text": "He would use the simplest, plainest language, he said to himself over and over again; but it is not always easy to use simple, plain language,—by no means so easy as to mount on stilts, and to march along with sesquipedalian words, with pathos, spasms, and notes of interjection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "833e6854-0c25-434e-9c6a-4368f182c347",
                                                "sense_id": "52fba30d-adf0-3f14-844a-bfcba01b2c57",
                                                "text": "Both Spear & Davis were indicted in the witchhunt surrounding the sensational (if nonexistent) \"Revere sex ring.\" Both men have said they have been police targets since at least 1975, following the anti-gay spasm which ensued after Dick Bavely's suicide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "spasm",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31bf3baa-e7aa-395c-980f-c43e58870130",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8cd902-902a-38c4-b47e-3a8c70ddfaaa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To produce and undergo a spasm or series of spasms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "832015c7-4f0c-46f7-8f28-d02767b6c984",
                        "source_entry_id": "37c3ab89-b006-386b-9d2b-3d1cb07ad613",
                        "source_sense_id": "e41aac19-34ff-3b58-8317-b7c146cfdb1b",
                        "target_lang_word": "spasme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "spasme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e565519d-09e2-35ad-8171-fa57ea385241",
                                        "entry_id": "33eb970f-bde6-3c22-8c21-8ed7a2ee7394",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Contraction involontaire, mouvement convulsif de certains muscles lisses ou striés."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02395c17-15df-48cf-b6f8-25ac68babc7b",
                                                "sense_id": "e565519d-09e2-35ad-8171-fa57ea385241",
                                                "text": "En lisant cette lettre, d’Artagnan sentait son cœur se dilater et s’étreindre de ce doux spasme qui torture et caresse le cœur des amants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0fb512b-214c-40d5-8ad9-a5749dc66091",
                                                "sense_id": "e565519d-09e2-35ad-8171-fa57ea385241",
                                                "text": "Le spasme la raidit, la tint frémissante… Puis la tête retomba et je serrai le petit corps tout faible contre moi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c412c840-af83-41cf-8118-740409039cba",
                                                "sense_id": "e565519d-09e2-35ad-8171-fa57ea385241",
                                                "text": "Les maladies du système nerveux central sont susceptibles de provoquer l’apparition de spasmes, souvent déclenchés, comme dans le cas du tétanos, par des stimulations nerveuses brutales telles qu’un bruit soudain de forte intensité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd8b25f6-5615-4715-8ce3-485b20904c42",
                                                "sense_id": "e565519d-09e2-35ad-8171-fa57ea385241",
                                                "text": "Ah ! comme la neige a neigé !\nMa vitre est un jardin de givre.\nAh ! comme la neige a neigé !\nQu’est-ce que le spasme de vivre\nÀ la douleur que j’ai, que j’ai."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eda5fec8-b58c-4f0e-a07c-14acce39705f",
                                                "sense_id": "e565519d-09e2-35ad-8171-fa57ea385241",
                                                "text": "Spasme gastrique. Spasme musculaire. Spasme tonique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "spasme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
